b2c.description:
The official Ford login page is protected by additional sign-in verification, so the integration cannot submit the password directly. Please complete the login in a browser and copy the authorization code:

1. Open the login link below in your computer or phone browser and sign in with your FordPass account (username: {username});
2. After login the browser redirects to ford.com.cn with ?code=... in the address bar. Copy that code and paste it here;
3. The code is single-use and expires right after the token exchange.

If the browser asks for verification or the page is unavailable, retry later or use SMS code login instead.

Login link:
{login_url}
